{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47323","headline":"晚到湖口见庐山作呈诸故人 · 吴筠","name":"晚到湖口见庐山作呈诸故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜舟达湖口，渐近庐山侧。\n高高标横天，隐隐何峻极。\n石镜啓晨晖，罏烟凝寒色。\n旅泊将休暇，归心已隮陟。\n虚名久爲累，使我辞逸域。\n良愿道不违，幽襟果兹得。\n故人在云峤，乃复同晏息。\n鸿飞入青冥，虞氏罢缯弋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}